<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Austrim agrees to raise Hawker bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Austrim agrees to raise Hawker bid.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment and manufacturing group Austrim Ltd said on Monday that it had agreed to raise its offer price for auto parts group Hawker Richardson Ltd to A$1.86 per share from A$1.60.</p>
<p>Austrim said Hawker Richardson now recommended acceptance of the bid in the absence of a higher offer.</p>
